    "descriptionOriginal": "A high-performance interactive 3D background featuring neon tubes that follow the cursor. Based on threejs-components, it includes a click interaction to randomize colors and a hero section overlay.\n\nSource: https://codepen.io/soju22/pen/qEbdVjK",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A high-performance interactive 3D background featuring neon tubes that follow the cursor. Based on threejs-components, it includes a click interaction to randomize colors and a hero section overlay.\n\nSource: https://codepen.io/soju22/pen/qEbdVjK Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
