    "titleOriginal": "Bold Editorial Studio Style",
    "titleFr": "Bold Editorial Studio Style (Version FR)",
    "descriptionOriginal": "Bold Editorial Studio Style is a high-impact, minimalist design system characterized by massive typography, a strict monochromatic palette, and sophisticated micro-interactions. It features a signature 'editorial' look using ultra-large display fonts (up to 12vw), custom cursor logic, and fluid marquee animations. Ideal for creative agencies, high-end portfolios, fashion brands, and premium fintech products, the system leverages white space and motion to create a premium, curated feel. Key elements include mix-blend-mode navigation, staggered text reveals, and asymmetrical image containers with varied border radii.",
