    "descriptionOriginal": "A premium, ultra-modern dark aesthetic featuring deep black backgrounds (#050505), massive 'Satoshi' typography for impact, and striking coral (#FF6B50) accents. Designed for high-end agencies and portfolios that prioritize storytelling and visual drama.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A premium, ultra-modern dark aesthetic featuring deep black backgrounds (#050505), massive 'Satoshi' typography for impact, and striking coral (#FF6B50) accents. Designed for high-end agencies and portfolios that prioritize storytelling and visual drama. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
