    "descriptionOriginal": "Loading animation UI featuring a character-like loader with animated lines, a body made from geometric shapes, and moving horizontal lines across the background. The loader have smooth animations with multiple synchronized motion effects including rotation, translation, and opacity fades.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : Loading animation UI featuring a character-like loader with animated lines, a body made from geometric shapes, and moving horizontal lines across the background. The loader have smooth animations with multiple synchronized motion effects including rotation, translation, and opacity fades. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
