    "descriptionOriginal": "An interactive, particle-based force field background effect that reacts to mouse movement. Uses p5.js to render particles based on image brightness maps, creating a fluid, magnetic visual experience.\n\nSource: https://codepen.io/vainsan/pen/ByoXMoB",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : An interactive, particle-based force field background effect that reacts to mouse movement. Uses p5.js to render particles based on image brightness maps, creating a fluid, magnetic visual experience.\n\nSource: https://codepen.io/vainsan/pen/ByoXMoB Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
