    "promptOriginal": "Create a text component that animates words changing like a physical slot machine or Rolodex. \n\n**Animation**: The old word should rotate 90° backward on the X-axis, while the new word flips up from the bottom. \n\n**Layout & Alignment**: This will be used inline (e.g., \"We Deliver [Word]\"). **CRITICAL**: Left-align the text within its container so it stays flush against the preceding text. \n\nDo not center it, or variable word lengths will create awkward gaps. \n\n**Technical**: Ensure the container uses preserve-3d and isn't strictly clipped, so the 3D rotation is fully visible.",
    "promptFr": "Tu agis comme un ingénieur frontend senior et un designer UI de premier rang.\n\nConstruis une interface de type « Rolodex Text (Version FR) » (Landing Page, style Kinetic & 3D WebGL) en React, TypeScript et Tailwind CSS.\n\nDIRECTIVES TECHNIQUES ET DESIGN :\n- Code entièrement modulaire, typé et accessible (WCAG AA).\n- Respect rigoureux des tokens de couleurs, des espacements et de la hiérarchie typographique.\n- Intégration soignée des interactions de survol et du responsive mobile.\n\nSPÉCIFICATION D'ORIGINE :\nCreate a text component that animates words changing like a physical slot machine or Rolodex. \n\n**Animation**: The old word should rotate 90° backward on the X-axis, while the new word flips up from the bottom. \n\n**Layout & Alignment**: This will be used inline (e.g., \"We Deliver [Word]\"). **CRITICAL**: Left-align the text within its container so it stays flush against the preceding text. \n\nDo not center it, or variable word lengths will create awkward gaps. \n\n**Technical**: Ensure the container uses preserve-3d and isn't strictly clipped, so the 3D rotation is fully visible.",
