    "titleFr": "Lightning Arrière-Plan",
    "descriptionOriginal": "A high-performance WebGL-powered lightning/electric discharge background effect. Features adjustable hue, intensity, speed, and scale. Built with GLSL shaders for smooth atmospheric motion.\n\nSource: ReactBits",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A high-performance WebGL-powered lightning/electric discharge background effect. Features adjustable hue, intensity, speed, and scale. Built with GLSL shaders for smooth atmospheric motion.\n\nSource: ReactBits Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
