    "descriptionOriginal": "A premium, interactive card stack component with drag-to-back physics, random rotations, and smooth motion transitions. Features autoplay, mobile-optimized interactions, and highly customizable animation configurations.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A premium, interactive card stack component with drag-to-back physics, random rotations, and smooth motion transitions. Features autoplay, mobile-optimized interactions, and highly customizable animation configurations. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
