    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : Dark aurora-glass split sign-in screen: frosted glassmorphic auth card with a glowing aqua focus ring and an aqua-to-magenta gradient CTA, floating over neon aurora blobs on near-black ink, beside a product pitch column. Space Grotesk + Inter. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
