    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A Swiss-grid SaaS marketing homepage: stark white paper, near-black ink, one signal-red accent, an oversized two-line hero, an embedded prompt-to-canvas product mock, a hover-invert feature grid, a dark variant-tile workflow split, a 3-tier pricing block with an inverted Pro card, and a hairline-celled mega footer. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
