    "descriptionOriginal": "A warm, social-first sign-up screen on a cream canvas: a two-column hero+signup landing with a friendly product pitch on the left (hand-drawn underline, teal-check benefits, a 5-star social-proof cluster) and a white rounded card on the right that leads with three full-width stacked social-auth buttons (Google, GitHub, Apple) above an 'or sign up with email' divider and a single email field with a coral 'Create account' CTA. Coral + teal accents, Poppins, a sticky blurred nav, a logo marquee, a three-step how-it-works, and a dark gradient CTA band.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A warm, social-first sign-up screen on a cream canvas: a two-column hero+signup landing with a friendly product pitch on the left (hand-drawn underline, teal-check benefits, a 5-star social-proof cluster) and a white rounded card on the right that leads with three full-width stacked social-auth buttons (Google, GitHub, Apple) above an 'or sign up with email' divider and a single email field with a coral 'Create account' CTA. Coral + teal accents, Poppins, a sticky blurred nav, a logo marquee, a three-step how-it-works, and a dark gradient CTA band. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
