    "descriptionOriginal": "A frameless dark SaaS pricing page in inky slate with one electric mint accent: an interactive ROI savings calculator, a 4-tier plan grid with a highlighted Pro card and monthly/annual toggle, a comparison table, and an accordion FAQ.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A frameless dark SaaS pricing page in inky slate with one electric mint accent: an interactive ROI savings calculator, a 4-tier plan grid with a highlighted Pro card and monthly/annual toggle, a comparison table, and an accordion FAQ. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
