    "descriptionOriginal": "A content-first navigation system that minimizes visible chrome and relies primarily on swipe gestures to move between major sections, creating an immersive and fluid experience.\n\nBest Suitable For\nMedia apps, reading apps, gallery-style products, experimental consumer experiences.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A content-first navigation system that minimizes visible chrome and relies primarily on swipe gestures to move between major sections, creating an immersive and fluid experience.\n\nBest Suitable For\nMedia apps, reading apps, gallery-style products, experimental consumer experiences. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
