    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A warm editorial SaaS pricing page on a cream canvas: a serif headline with an electric-blue italic accent, two self-serve plan cards (one highlighted) beside a dark near-black Enterprise contact-sales panel with gold accents, plus a monthly/annual toggle. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
