    "descriptionOriginal": "A frameless, near-black dev-tool SaaS pricing page with one electric-blue accent, oversized outlined-type headline, and a single-plan card (monthly/annual toggle + optional power-up add-ons) instead of a tier wall.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A frameless, near-black dev-tool SaaS pricing page with one electric-blue accent, oversized outlined-type headline, and a single-plan card (monthly/annual toggle + optional power-up add-ons) instead of a tier wall. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
    "category": "Landing Page",
