    "titleFr": "Account Setup Flow — Goals / Interests (Card-Based) (Version FR)",
    "descriptionOriginal": "A sleek, minimalist, and highly interactive 4-step onboarding flow designed for mobile-first experiences. Features high-contrast black and white aesthetics, modern typography using General Sans, and fluid motion using the View Transitions API. Ideal for SaaS, fintech, or lifestyle apps needing a premium, frictionless user registration or configuration sequence. Key elements include a persistent progress bar, springy micro-interactions, and clear, bold editorial typography.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A sleek, minimalist, and highly interactive 4-step onboarding flow designed for mobile-first experiences. Features high-contrast black and white aesthetics, modern typography using General Sans, and fluid motion using the View Transitions API. Ideal for SaaS, fintech, or lifestyle apps needing a premium, frictionless user registration or configuration sequence. Key elements include a persistent progress bar, springy micro-interactions, and clear, bold editorial typography. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
    "category": "Landing Page",
