    "id": "sd-sectioned-index-page",
    "slug": "sectioned-index-page",
    "titleOriginal": "Sectioned Index Page",
    "titleFr": "Sectioned Index Page (Version FR)",
    "descriptionOriginal": "Features a mixed-media layout including horizontal snap-scrolling cards, vertical activity feeds, and a bento-style recommendation grid. Ideal for content aggregators, interior design apps, portfolio indexes, or minimalist fintech dashboards.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : Features a mixed-media layout including horizontal snap-scrolling cards, vertical activity feeds, and a bento-style recommendation grid. Ideal for content aggregators, interior design apps, portfolio indexes, or minimalist fintech dashboards. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
