    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A high-contrast editorial \"Now Playing\" mobile music player: a light cream top with a warm sunset gradient album art, bold track title + scrubber, dark high-contrast transport controls on cream circles, over a deep forest-green \"Up Next\" playlist with a coral now-playing highlight. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
