    "titleFr": "Loam — Warm Earthy Organic Agency Site Web",
    "descriptionOriginal": "Warm earthy organic agency / studio website: sand + terracotta palette, Fraunces serif display type, organic leaf-blob shapes, sticky blurred nav, project-card grid, numbered services list, and a terracotta contact block with a mock prompt form.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : Warm earthy organic agency / studio website: sand + terracotta palette, Fraunces serif display type, organic leaf-blob shapes, sticky blurred nav, project-card grid, numbered services list, and a terracotta contact block with a mock prompt form. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
