    "descriptionOriginal": "An editorial SaaS onboarding experience featuring a calm, sophisticated aesthetic. It uses a muted warm stone palette with terracotta accents, high-contrast serif headlines (Crimson Pro) paired with clean sans-serif UI text (Inter). The layout follows a natural document flow within a product shell, avoiding scroll-locks or overlays. Suitable for premium B2B SaaS, design tools, publishing platforms, and luxury fintech applications that prioritize a confident, professional, and non-intrusive user experience.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : An editorial SaaS onboarding experience featuring a calm, sophisticated aesthetic. It uses a muted warm stone palette with terracotta accents, high-contrast serif headlines (Crimson Pro) paired with clean sans-serif UI text (Inter). The layout follows a natural document flow within a product shell, avoiding scroll-locks or overlays. Suitable for premium B2B SaaS, design tools, publishing platforms, and luxury fintech applications that prioritize a confident, professional, and non-intrusive user experience. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
