    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : An electric-lime fitness/health dashboard on near-black: a big animated step-progress ring, stat chips, a weekly-activity bar chart, health insights, a workouts list, a challenge card, and an achievements grid with a bottom nav. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
