    "descriptionOriginal": "A stacked, multi-section account-settings form on a white card: top-aligned labels, helper text, a 6-column responsive grid, custom checkboxes and radios, and one disciplined emerald accent for focus and the primary action.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A stacked, multi-section account-settings form on a white card: top-aligned labels, helper text, a 6-column responsive grid, custom checkboxes and radios, and one disciplined emerald accent for focus and the primary action. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
