    "descriptionOriginal": "A two-column SaaS workspace-settings screen: sticky app nav, left section nav, grouped settings cards with toggles, a segmented control, selectable delivery cards, and a fixed save bar, in Inter on slate with one cobalt accent.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A two-column SaaS workspace-settings screen: sticky app nav, left section nav, grouped settings cards with toggles, a segmented control, selectable delivery cards, and a fixed save bar, in Inter on slate with one cobalt accent. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
