    "descriptionOriginal": "A joyful pastel success-celebration modal as the live centerpiece of a light SaaS page: a cream rounded-5xl dialog with a pulsing-ring animated checkmark badge, a gradient 'Continue to dashboard' CTA and a ghost secondary, floating over a full-bleed confetti layer on a cream-to-sky radial field. Below it a 3-up pattern-library card band, a starter-kit split with a stacked mini upgrade modal, a dark-ink CTA band and a cream footer. Pastel sky + coral are decorative-only; all colored text uses darkened >=4.5:1 tokens (#0369a1 / #be123c) and every gradient button runs deep stops behind white — legibility fixed. Poppins throughout.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A joyful pastel success-celebration modal as the live centerpiece of a light SaaS page: a cream rounded-5xl dialog with a pulsing-ring animated checkmark badge, a gradient 'Continue to dashboard' CTA and a ghost secondary, floating over a full-bleed confetti layer on a cream-to-sky radial field. Below it a 3-up pattern-library card band, a starter-kit split with a stacked mini upgrade modal, a dark-ink CTA band and a cream footer. Pastel sky + coral are decorative-only; all colored text uses darkened >=4.5:1 tokens (#0369a1 / #be123c) and every gradient button runs deep stops behind white — legibility fixed. Poppins throughout. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
