    "descriptionOriginal": "OTP / two-factor verification screen on warm paper with a graphite + platinum palette: a Two-factor eyebrow pill, a glass card with a lock icon, six single-digit code boxes, progress dots, a live resend countdown and a Verify code button. Inter, light mode, no saturated color.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : OTP / two-factor verification screen on warm paper with a graphite + platinum palette: a Two-factor eyebrow pill, a glass card with a lock icon, six single-digit code boxes, progress dots, a live resend countdown and a Verify code button. Inter, light mode, no saturated color. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
