    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : Warm, illustrated AI design-agent sign-in landing in sky-blue and coral: a sticky frosted nav over a two-panel side-panel login card (gradient illustration aside plus email, password and social auth), floating blobs, dot-grid texture and rounded-everything Nunito type. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
