    "descriptionOriginal": "A high-energy, Gen-Z-inspired design system with a 'Neo-Brutalist' aesthetic. This style features high-saturation colors like acid green (#ccff00), vibrant purple (#7000ff), and hot pink (#ff0099), paired with heavy black borders and hard shadows. It utilizes expressive, oversized typography and intentional layout chaos through asymmetrical sections and tilted elements. Ideal for social media apps, youth-oriented fintech, creative portfolios, and lifestyle products that prioritize attitude over corporate structure.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A high-energy, Gen-Z-inspired design system with a 'Neo-Brutalist' aesthetic. This style features high-saturation colors like acid green (#ccff00), vibrant purple (#7000ff), and hot pink (#ff0099), paired with heavy black borders and hard shadows. It utilizes expressive, oversized typography and intentional layout chaos through asymmetrical sections and tilted elements. Ideal for social media apps, youth-oriented fintech, creative portfolios, and lifestyle products that prioritize attitude over corporate structure. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
