    "id": "sd-high-energy-onboarding",
    "slug": "high-energy-onboarding",
    "titleOriginal": "High energy onboarding",
    "titleFr": "High energy onboarding (Version FR)",
    "descriptionOriginal": "A maximalist, neobrutalist design system featuring unconventional geometric typography, high-contrast colors, and interactive card stacking. Built for energetic SaaS onboarding, creative platforms, or experimental fintech interfaces. Uses Clash Display and Satoshi fonts with hard shadows (#2D1B4E), vibrant accents in orange (#FF7D2E) and cyan (#00D4FF), and a signature noise-textured background overlay.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A maximalist, neobrutalist design system featuring unconventional geometric typography, high-contrast colors, and interactive card stacking. Built for energetic SaaS onboarding, creative platforms, or experimental fintech interfaces. Uses Clash Display and Satoshi fonts with hard shadows (#2D1B4E), vibrant accents in orange (#FF7D2E) and cyan (#00D4FF), and a signature noise-textured background overlay. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
