    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A trustworthy deep-teal fintech-startup landing page with a mint accent and cream text: a split hero with a product dashboard mock and a floating virtual card, a bento feature grid, a stats traction band, a security certifications grid, and a glowing CTA. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
