    "descriptionOriginal": "A modern product-launch / feature-announcement email in a centered 600px column: a heavy Sora headline with a cobalt pill CTA, a coral-to-pink gradient hero card framing a product-UI vignette, three alternating feature blocks each with a designed mini-UI (a prompt bar to a live preview, a component-token grid, a syntax-highlighted code snippet) and an outline button, a dark closing CTA band, and a minimal legal footer. Sora + Inter, ink on white with a warm coral gradient and a single cobalt accent. Reusable as any SaaS feature or launch announcement email.",
