    "descriptionOriginal": "A dramatic film-premiere invitation email that acts as a digital movie poster, in a centered 600px column: a crimson-to-black field, a four-name cast row, a condensed Anton title ('EMPIRE OF SHADOWS') over a red-duotoned figure, the premiere date, two evenly-weighted CTAs (Claim tickets / Watch trailer), a line-separated 'Screenings' itinerary, and a dense movie-billing credit block. Reusable for premieres, VIP launches, and entertainment event invites.",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A dramatic film-premiere invitation email that acts as a digital movie poster, in a centered 600px column: a crimson-to-black field, a four-name cast row, a condensed Anton title ('EMPIRE OF SHADOWS') over a red-duotoned figure, the premiere date, two evenly-weighted CTAs (Claim tickets / Watch trailer), a line-separated 'Screenings' itinerary, and a dense movie-billing credit block. Reusable for premieres, VIP launches, and entertainment event invites. Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
