    "titleOriginal": "Claymorphism Mobile App: Pastel Habit Tracker Home",
    "titleFr": "Claymorphism Mobile Application: Pastel Habit Tracker Home",
    "descriptionOriginal": "A light claymorphism mobile app home screen for a friendly habit and wellness tracker. Soft, inflated pastel \"clay\" cards (sage, peach, butter-yellow, sky-blue) on a cool cream-grey ground, with the signature dual soft shadow plus inset highlight that makes every surface look puffy. A rounded Nunito type scale, a tracked-caps date over a single bold greeting, a sage progress hero card with a rounded-cap progress bar and a streak chip, two puffy stat tiles, a scannable habit list with clear done-versus-pending toggle states, and an in-flow floating tab bar with a raised peach round add button. Light mode, real phone proportions, no dark neumorphism and no purple gradient. Reusable for any friendly consumer app home (habit, wellness, mood, budgeting, language learning).",
    "descriptionFr": "Spécification d'interface : A light claymorphism mobile app home screen for a friendly habit and wellness tracker. Soft, inflated pastel \"clay\" cards (sage, peach, butter-yellow, sky-blue) on a cool cream-grey ground, with the signature dual soft shadow plus inset highlight that makes every surface look puffy. A rounded Nunito type scale, a tracked-caps date over a single bold greeting, a sage progress hero card with a rounded-cap progress bar and a streak chip, two puffy stat tiles, a scannable habit list with clear done-versus-pending toggle states, and an in-flow floating tab bar with a raised peach round add button. Light mode, real phone proportions, no dark neumorphism and no purple gradient. Reusable for any friendly consumer app home (habit, wellness, mood, budgeting, language learning). Conçu pour un rendu haute fidélité avec interactions fluides et typographie soignée.",
